<body>
    <h1>Interview Discussion</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 local-id=3D"e25289242767" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Beneficiary=
Creation&amp;PaymentWorkflow=E2=80=93UXReviewMeetingSummary">Beneficiary Cr=
eation &amp; Payment Workflow =E2=80=93 UX Review Meeting Summary</h2>
<p local-id=3D"7191d4a8fbe0"><strong>Meeting Participants</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d21f7370-86c4-4780-8836-a2361b81e650">
<li local-id=3D"8eacd542-7c42-4b54-90ff-0c7e33b0992a">
<p local-id=3D"6a50bea2fcbf">Seema Mathiyarasu</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab9633b8-024e-406f-b3a1-e5ccdb0d6984">
<p local-id=3D"40e4ca5dbfed">Paul Bliss</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"45e660cd-812b-48d7-962a-eb5a4da089cd">
<p local-id=3D"96065a036aab">Joanne Bliss</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"61ca9cc8-8f88-4bbc-b74f-434997cdb7ec">
<p local-id=3D"bb71ec07ac97">Arumugam V</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"7df47ec441a1"><strong>Purpose</strong> Review the proposed U=
X design for Beneficiary Creation, Draft Management, Payment Details Entry,=
 Currency Configuration, and VAT handling within the payment workflow.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"a89b02de-ae6c-4719-80c0-7cd2a4e42b05">
<h1 local-id=3D"6634fe670d3d" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-1.ExecutiveSummary"=
>1. Executive Summary</h1>
<p local-id=3D"e67cbcee69ff">The discussion focused on validating the UX fl=
ow for beneficiary creation and payment setup. Key decisions were made rega=
rding:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e1c24dbf-83f6-476b-8126-57c08ba29d98">
<li local-id=3D"8f6934e2-fe9b-430f-b207-dc71785462be">
<p local-id=3D"2b4fd260d9a8">Introducing a <strong>Draft</strong> status fo=
r incomplete beneficiary forms.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"688f0eff-57e2-4d0d-a119-c775fc827e10">
<p local-id=3D"c5c53f32973a">Supporting <strong>Resume Draft</strong> funct=
ionality.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"10d08c26-498a-4164-a024-85f3d604d448">
<p local-id=3D"40e6249239ac">Maintaining consistency with existing Ad Hoc p=
ayment forms.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d5465259-c043-4601-9979-7c075f9a1772">
<p local-id=3D"3355fbf4f8ee">Reusing existing payment fields and validation=
 rules.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e18d59f4-f1a7-496d-971b-b9ba29417c41">
<p local-id=3D"8816dedfde9a">Loading currencies from an administration/conf=
iguration module.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"65ebb9cf-bafb-4ffc-aee6-ff1ce4402b8b">
<p local-id=3D"6adf98ccb7ce">Applying existing VAT journal logic from Vehic=
le Release Payments to the new module.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ac383d1b-1a0e-4be3-8f3e-02dc29ea1c30">
<p local-id=3D"17c3ffd3ade8">Updating the prototype based on stakeholder fe=
edback.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"663ee1ec-b48d-4cf8-a906-08b0cf6182a5">
<h1 local-id=3D"9108236e099a" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-2.UXInterviewQuesti=
ons&amp;DiscussionOutcomes">2. UX Interview Questions &amp; Discussion Outc=
omes</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"2993989ddd2a" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-SectionA=E2=80=93Be=
neficiaryCreationFlow">Section A =E2=80=93 Beneficiary Creation Flow</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"e9b283f01bac" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q1.Howshouldthecurr=
entstepbeindicatedintheworkflow?">Q1. How should the current step be indica=
ted in the workflow?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"1b36289416bd"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b3de6692246a">The current step should only be visually highl=
ighted.</p>
<p local-id=3D"442eab6aea49"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"86da0c17-5e5f-4337-be41-fe780b1ec493">
<li local-id=3D"0708b29a-cb65-476d-a079-0ee75e42bcb5">
<p local-id=3D"f22fb5211c5f">Current stage is highlighted.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d3559757-a6a1-4139-972d-2892c0d07988">
<p local-id=3D"997b90b60dd3">Steps are not selectable/clickable.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9669c25e-5837-459b-a73f-895270a20535">
<p local-id=3D"bf2d287bbb29">Users cannot jump between stages.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3c1aacd59943"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6bfbe681ac4d">=E2=9C=85 Use a non-clickable step indicator s=
howing current progress only.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"c71062c0-c653-4c2b-b502-a54e2457a15a">
<h3 local-id=3D"b0745ae2f141" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q2.Whathappensafter=
enteringabeneficiaryname?">Q2. What happens after entering a beneficiary na=
me?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"96fae96f83da"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e9a58e6c653d">The beneficiary name is the first mandatory in=
put.</p>
<p local-id=3D"728c87d1188f"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"61c9a2af-cff0-48ab-82e8-a6d5edd50d94">
<li local-id=3D"20595dc7-4560-4fb3-8255-d196632f39bd">
<p local-id=3D"02f471f7f38a">User enters Beneficiary Name.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"20db64dc-209a-43a2-8586-9277f891a0a8">
<p local-id=3D"514a6d3132be">"Next" button remains disabled until a valid n=
ame is entered.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2cced248ffa5"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"daeca9c03acd">=E2=9C=85 Enable Next button only after Benefi=
ciary Name validation succeeds.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"e959d6c9-ad92-4a3d-830a-9e788d684c6a">
<h2 local-id=3D"ffaa9f022c69" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-SectionB=E2=80=93Dr=
aftFunctionality">Section B =E2=80=93 Draft Functionality</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"19acf7d0c9d2" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q3.WhyintroduceaDra=
ftstatus?">Q3. Why introduce a Draft status?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"6f7761a9ffb4"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"ea61b6ac2ce6">Previously users could only:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"38e9c3ae-0f61-437c-af20-31e8133c98e9">
<li local-id=3D"ad55ec5f-cc84-43c9-af9c-13f6a91a1923">
<p local-id=3D"14f065702eae">Save completed records</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"42f8883a-93b3-42de-af13-5cbdf317f10b">
<p local-id=3D"f838caa36b28">Discard changes</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"47763c046ed5">No option existed to pause work.</p>
<p local-id=3D"305e1ed0fad9"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5a61e7e48133">New Draft status allows users to:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"40a0aa37-34e5-4938-bab2-9768f56f5adf">
<li local-id=3D"0aba2413-9494-4ba2-be6b-d5839a0240b3">
<p local-id=3D"7255e7f83a30">Save incomplete forms</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c5f670d5-da48-4cbc-a6e2-f1c3ca61499e">
<p local-id=3D"6c7312ef13e7">Exit process</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7015de07-a70f-4b27-86a2-23699939fc9b">
<p local-id=3D"241ee7391548">Return later</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a220a0ee-00ab-44a1-b73a-aaedb32f2f23">
<p local-id=3D"db39376222f3">Continue from where they stopped</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a9457b61e44d"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"43ee4de803fa">=E2=9C=85 Add "Save as Draft" action.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"6a194945-03fc-472c-8f77-a173846a3943">
<h3 local-id=3D"10831b89017b" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q4.Howshouldusersco=
ntinueeditingDraftrecords?">Q4. How should users continue editing Draft rec=
ords?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"192e4daa563b"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"51116f94c7ca">Users need a seamless continuation experience.=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"ef54e28731ab"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"08f92f76-0a87-4c04-9753-5d10263e4012">
<li local-id=3D"58c2079c-1738-4503-8a86-e7a24eb30afc">
<p local-id=3D"a143481ae5b2">Draft records appear with Draft status.</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"42a75ff4-6598-485c-b720-4a6aee0237e2">
<p local-id=3D"94d382780c2b">Selecting a Draft provides a Resume option.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"cde7208f-4e21-46fc-874e-990c970a4105">
<p local-id=3D"bf35778cb8be">User returns to the exact stage previously com=
pleted.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0948e6c337c8"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5fa9bf685355">=E2=9C=85 Resume Draft functionality required.=
</p>
<hr local-id=3D"1f61b870-b52c-47f8-9bb5-fd984260e8cb">
<h2 local-id=3D"81f20a8ac3bd" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-SectionC=E2=80=93Pa=
ymentTypeSelection">Section C =E2=80=93 Payment Type Selection</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"f6284140a98f" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q5.Whatpaymentoptio=
nsareavailable?">Q5. What payment options are available?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"61827a963162"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"8c82f65c32de">User must choose a payment type before enterin=
g banking details.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ec5d2abb45ba"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"331330a29b16">Supported options:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"48c82762-d767-44e6-8824-897dddd06d7e">
<li local-id=3D"6b2dd945-d3ef-44e4-a4fe-f821e521940a">
<p local-id=3D"d5a26c70bf2b">International Payment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"86ab768e-9e89-448d-8d16-58bed9a6d3f9">
<p local-id=3D"8008d18e9059">UK Payment</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"a3177cbbd4d4"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"0e7817afacd5">=E2=9C=85 Payment type selection is mandatory.=
</p>
<hr local-id=3D"39f1d47e-b0b3-4f0f-b903-a9b00dc14f35">
<h3 local-id=3D"f2e4d0377f74" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q6.Whatfieldsarereq=
uiredforInternationalPayments?">Q6. What fields are required for Internatio=
nal Payments?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"da53f4ee1fc0"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b54ee7689d19">Existing Ad Hoc payment flow fields will be re=
used.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0adf89bb183d"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d=
a5c9390-8014-49af-a3f2-3253a594ee85" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4d39909c-59c9-4169-880d-fcf9b0169c69">
<th data-local-id=3D"0bd11c93-cde3-43ab-b163-217ec8ab94c3" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3fb58b31ee78">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1b7a5361-44d9-49a4-b04a-ab4dfcda57c8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"55bf0028680b">Required</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fa55c092-685b-4e66-8be6-3165a50df767">
<td data-local-id=3D"b78ad28a-817e-4bbb-bc4e-a62ad3907d80" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"36c70bed4193">Sort Code</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8cc9d4a1-5299-4aea-a258-3890a8cc31d9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4fd1cbb3a909">Yes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f13e8831-034a-4f87-a0dc-a7f658cc3c72">
<td data-local-id=3D"e15af326-caa1-4e4b-ba5f-df6ca89a68ce" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1ab17b22706">Account Number</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b969b798-ed67-4fa3-a164-5ca538693b57" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c28f5c964934">Yes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"67abe35a-3266-4df5-90d2-18478a81a371">
<td data-local-id=3D"661d2b6f-8f74-4cb3-9008-c6787642432d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2454b2689b20">Currency</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3a7d9a32-ea64-4031-bfc8-43a0f4de538e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0b42e3fd48e6">Yes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a06f1b7f-515c-42df-b10c-e70626a6836b">
<td data-local-id=3D"0e7bd1df-12ff-47b7-87b1-4057ece43e09" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6931f24eef6e">IBAN</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f134dca3-07ef-492c-8498-345f60df85c9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"95a088bcb5e8">Optional</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e26a9248-34c1-428d-80f6-96a2c0fde72f">
<td data-local-id=3D"0360199d-6e0b-4ad2-83ac-9cbba7f222ea" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3b645010adb1">BIC</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e276d484-946f-4e7f-a991-d0ad902b9fc5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4e3e2ffc3f7b">Optional</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"04017ab9f126"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"42cc2bdf1651">=E2=9C=85 Follow existing Ad Hoc payment struc=
ture.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"80f69f6d-1c2c-47ad-8f5d-88c1f6ff4ca5">
<h3 local-id=3D"fa55f63c1fb7" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q7.Whatfieldsarereq=
uiredforUKPayments?">Q7. What fields are required for UK Payments?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f7d5e8f0eb39"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1=
8fac3b0-16a3-4d01-81f3-86e18cdc2e87" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1d14deaf-e6ef-43f2-b7df-f587a79f001e">
<th data-local-id=3D"b7b12456-e672-4cb7-a4dd-ae6db6d0ed08" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ad6389d2bebf">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b4ae9203-245f-4aea-8e45-be785af66012" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f95f949b1354">Required</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"45e94464-ccc5-4b89-b5b5-043b19ef7415">
