>
<hr local-id=3D"ce97aa62-0218-4ba7-9ab8-c2723835c21b">
<h2 local-id=3D"095290b19ac7" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-SectionD=E2=80=93Cu=
rrencyConfiguration">Section D =E2=80=93 Currency Configuration</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"2c195422a932" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q8.Whereshouldcurre=
ncyvaluescomefrom?">Q8. Where should currency values come from?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"46c2aae6e7d2"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e1d6d9bf71f0">Currency values should not be hardcoded.</p>
<p local-id=3D"07a64372bc2c"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b8d6b7df83ee">Currencies are maintained through a dedicated =
Configuration module.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a3f483f44677"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"b21540c9f945">=E2=9C=85 Currency dropdown populated dynamica=
lly from Configuration settings.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"fa3daefb-d305-4454-b192-932209dbe5d1">
<h3 local-id=3D"bbb9607de7c7" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q9.Whatisthebenefit=
ofconfiguration-drivencurrencies?">Q9. What is the benefit of configuration=
-driven currencies?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"dca6232ba40c"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a0506eb3-d820-4e99-8fa2-aaa05fa41a03">
<li local-id=3D"7a577f56-43c0-429a-a778-a010054a30b9">
<p local-id=3D"3ca9d9cc1bd2">Centralized management</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"23cc1998-c346-44d3-9d6b-5b5ee408de75">
<p local-id=3D"1e451171cf6e">Easy administration</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"446644a8-3003-4de5-916a-2cdf83826cfe">
<p local-id=3D"32272b47a340">Future scalability</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ec5c7218-d27d-4fc5-ae03-62857ebcf0da">
<p local-id=3D"e241bb7bf67a">No development dependency for currency updates=
</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"cb6c50032f90"><strong>UX Recommendation</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d348c2ba5b4c">=E2=9C=85 Add empty-state handling when no cur=
rencies are configured.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"9c9fc6d8-5ed5-4cb7-8797-f762174e3d4a">
<h2 local-id=3D"63e5cd9815d4" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-SectionE=E2=80=93VA=
THandling">Section E =E2=80=93 VAT Handling</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"718427a28134" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q10.HowshouldVATbeh=
andledinthenewworkflow?">Q10. How should VAT be handled in the new workflow=
?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"08955ed030cd"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"11c6bcec9f74">Paul clarified that VAT processing already exi=
sts in the Vehicle Release Payment module.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e1290ef69582"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"c5f584b7f533">The same business logic must be reused.</p>
<p local-id=3D"6425a179df8f"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"1546899009a8">=E2=9C=85 Apply existing Vehicle Release Payme=
nt VAT logic.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"269e4ec4-7a14-4d50-a35b-8cdc23f9508f">
<h3 local-id=3D"2433947d52fb" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q11.Whathappenswhen=
VATisincluded?">Q11. What happens when VAT is included?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"81c56490afee"><strong>Discussion</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"0b118a429b3a">Journal creation changes when VAT is present.<=
/p>
<p local-id=3D"2c26b2885623"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"e6a5b4859b9b">Without VAT:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"31385cf1-ecc3-4885-b9ad-988a3d12b4c2">
<li local-id=3D"931af43d-8871-4a05-ad4d-ec7c5ed8110b">
<p local-id=3D"07a81f030a90">Standard journal entry</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d5edd600b470">With VAT:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"bb840030-e3b2-4ea0-8586-83a94c968afe">
<li local-id=3D"0af1a763-fbed-463c-9330-77ba636e496f">
<p local-id=3D"972b247cbf60">Three-line journal format generated</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9a644d11-7822-4d19-9a06-0aac7352e6f6">
<p local-id=3D"4412e82c04e3">Follows Vehicle Release Payment implementation=
</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"92c9b2823622"><strong>Stakeholder Direction</strong></p>
<blockquote local-id=3D"b79ca6f9-8009-48c1-9f89-1d7366c43385">
<p local-id=3D"0d373a40f61e">"Copy exactly the same logic from Vehicle Rele=
ase Payments."</p>
</blockquote>
<p local-id=3D"a6bcd759bf6f">=E2=80=94 Paul Bliss</p>
<hr local-id=3D"fe4be6a9-f953-41bf-8bab-b44934553b35">
<h3 local-id=3D"b20669a4e424" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-Q12.IsanynewVATinte=
ractionrequiredfromusers?">Q12. Is any new VAT interaction required from us=
ers?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"0d87c6d9de2c"><strong>Answer</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"47fe38a5714e">No new behavior was requested.</p>
<p local-id=3D"600edf1bb08c">The expectation is:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"4534047c-7445-42cb-9da9-7764da09211c">
<li local-id=3D"a3d7d713-6d8c-4d95-a73f-0870827c4d77">
<p local-id=3D"7c0ec9b3ae50">Existing VAT experience remains consistent.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"f00d871b-7d74-4a28-81a6-3fafa76bbfa0">
<p local-id=3D"e7c62d406c15">Business logic works identically to Vehicle Re=
lease Payments.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"303856c010c4"><strong>UX Decision</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5af42e7a3d83">=E2=9C=85 Maintain consistency across modules.=
<br><br>
3. UX Changes Required</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"52e0202d213a" id=3D"InterviewDiscussion-HighPriorityChanges=
">High Priority Changes</h2>
